 class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">细节；详情；具体内容；详细的；具体的；细致的；（数字地图的）放大视图；近景详图</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126033\"><ruby>調査<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>詳細<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らかにするだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">调查将揭示细节。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昇進</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">晋升；晋级；升职</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109179\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>課長<rp>(</rp><rt>かちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>昇進<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他晋升为首席执行官。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">少数</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうすう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">少数；少量；少数派</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192728\">ヨットは<ruby>少数<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうすう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>金持<rp>(</rp><rt>かねも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちだけが<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しめるものだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">游艇只有少数富人才能享受。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">称する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class