(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">沉默往往意味着承认。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">象徴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">象征；标志；代表</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227469\">オリーブの<ruby>枝<rp>(</rp><rt>えだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>平和<rp>(</rp><rt>へいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>象徴<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">橄榄枝象征着和平。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小児科</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうにか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">儿科</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">証人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうにん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">证人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97904\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らはその<ruby>証人<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買収<rp>(</rp><rt>ばいしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しようとしたがだめだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们试图收购证人,但没有。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">照明</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうめい</span></div><div cla